// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1578321831" "Surprise?  Good.  Here's another.  Pain."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3491637199" "Coralax will not be ignored!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2053807753" "You will pay for what you have done to us!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1639111667" "Your death will be my pleasure, land-walker!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2689481235" "They do not know who they are dealing with."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3360747959" "Coralax needs to make ourselves heard."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2229297011" "The time of the land-walker is over.  Ours is coming."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4055503889" "You underestimate the Coralax!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1807179348" "You dare to interrupt me!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_FISHEAT_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P180487705" "Get the land-walker!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3541801571" "This area is ours.  Let's keep it that way."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P990013695" "Prevent access to the water."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3539537936" "No more polluting of our home.  Keep alert."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2648950484" "No land-walker may breach the water."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P529667325" "You know what to do!  Get them!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2252314710" "A mistake, land-walker!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2334037960" "Do not mess with the Coralax!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2257848204" "You shouldn't have fooled with the Coralax!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3445839337" "The Coralax will not be ignored!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2989329169" "You have made a big mistake underestimating the Coralax!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1690222741" "Oil Spill will absorb your blood!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1557369705" "This is Coralax business!  You interfere!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P525342227" "Let me show you how the Coralax deals with interference!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1055277830" "Oil Spill will see more than oil on the ground this day!"

// NERVA_ALLHOODS_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4234320329" "Now who is the bait?"
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P817167226" "Now who is the predator and who is the prey?"
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1329629827" "Coralax will reign!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_BEACHPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1748709086" "This beach is ours.  Let's keep it that way."


// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3993183165" "Land-walkers pollute the beach!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_FISHAMBUSH_FISHMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3745097069" "Humans...hate them."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4103048434" "The dry ones get too close to the water.  We can't let them."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4105204424" "Humans..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3632681884" "Dry ones..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1363515526" "We will harvest the land-walkers when the time is right."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1215633560" "They have no idea...the future we will prepare for them."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1921493699" "Get the land-walkers!"

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2759921868" "Keep the waters clear."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1403510500" "Back to the ridge.  I saw more land-walkers there."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P935966907" "Land...too long...need water..."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P866259850" "Dry ones!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1225521965" "Now!  Strike!"

// GRANDVILLE_HIDDENAREA_WAITING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P545355813" "Landwalker!  How did you get in here?!"
// GRANDVILLE_HIDDENAREA_WAITING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3917905608" "How did you find me, Landwalker!  You will pay!"
// GRANDVILLE_HIDDENAREA_WAITING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3985328904" "Now you are in trouble!"
// GRANDVILLE_HIDDENAREA_WAITING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1868363814" "It ends here, Landwalker!"

